    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwanya gwa Migate I'zyo Zikatumba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Munsondohezye ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya. Ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa V'aizilaeli na ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ndimu vili' vyanne.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wav'awi'laga v'antu' ati', “Mulwizu'ki'le lu'siku' lwenu'lu' u'lo mwafumaga mu nsi' ya Misili, u'mo mwav'age v'asese. Lwenu'lu' hu' lu'siku' u'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamufumya mwenu'mu ku' nguzu zya mukono gwakwe. Mugati' na lu'siku' lwenu'lu', ku'du' mwize mulye mugate u'go gu'li' na itumbyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwenu'lu', mwezi gwa kwandya gwa Abibu, muku'wu'ka mu nsi' ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'ku'v'a aho Gu'ku' Mulungu alamufikye ku' nsi' ya V'akanaani, V'ahiti, V'aamoli, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi, nsi' i'yo walahi'la ku' v'agu'ku' v'inywe ku'v'a alav'ape, nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki', yi'lamudime ku'lu'v'ezezya mwizu' lu'siku' lu'hanya lwenu'lu' mugati' na mwezi gwenu'gu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba, na lu'siku' lwa mupungati' gu'lav'e mwanya gwa ku'muku'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' itungo lyeni'lo lya nsiku' mupungati', mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba. Ku'du' kize kigele ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'li' na itumbyo, ninga ki'la itumbyo ku'du' lize ligele ku' winywe, ninga mugati' na nsi' yinywe yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwenu'lo mulav'awi'le v'ana v'inywe ati', ‘ku'li'v'ezya vyeni'vi ku'nguno ya igambo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' waku'v'ezezya aho kwav'age ku'li'wu'ka ku' nsi' ya Misili.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanya gwenu'go gu'lav'e hu' mwizu' ki'ti' lu'manyi'lo u'lo lu'tungilwe ku' makono ginywe na ku' wu'syu' winywe, ki'gele nzi'la ya nhana yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu yi'v'e mu milomo zinywe. Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu hu' mwene wamufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ku' nguzu zya mukono gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'mudima muyi'dime nhama yeni'yi' ku' ki'la mwaka ku' itungo lyalyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'v'asondohya v'av'yalwa v'a mbele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wendeleyaga ku'v'awi'la v'antu' ati', “Yi'lav'e aho Gu'ku' Mulungu alav'e wamufikya ku' nsi' ya Kanaani na ku'mupa inywe nsi' yeni'yo, ki'ti' i'vyo walahi'la ku' winywe na ku' v'agu'ku' v'inywe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yi'li'mudima ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya. Hangi' ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ki'gosya cha mitugo zinywe ki'lav'e chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha mpunda mulaki'komole ku' ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu kadi'lana, ali'vi u'lu' mukaanile ku'ki'komola, mulaki'wu'lage lwa ku'ki'vuna nhingo yacho. Hangi' ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya wa muntu' mulamukomole ku' ku'fumya kadi'lana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' yi'lav'e mu nsiku' zya mbele, u'lu' v'ana v'inywe v'iza v'awu'zya ati', ‘Yeni'yi' yi'li' na nguno ki'?’ U'lav'awi'le ati', ‘Ku' mukono gwakwe gwa nguzu, Gu'ku' Mulungu waku'fumya ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko kwav'age v'asese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'age aho Falao ndi' wiv'ezya ku'v'a na moyo mulambu ku'ku'zumi'zya ku'wu'ke, hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wav'awu'laga ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya mu Misili, na ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ki'gosya cha mitugo. Yeni'yi' hu' nguno nu'fumya ki'taambo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha mitugo cha ki'gosya, ali'vi ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa v'ana v'anne wa ki'gosya nu'mukomola.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igambo lyeni'li' li'lav'e ki'ti' lu'manyi'lo u'lo lu'tungilwe ku' makono gako na ku' wu'syu' wako, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu hu' mwene waku'fumya ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku' nguzu zya mukono gwakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nhi'ngi' ya ilunde na moto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo i'lo Falao wav'aleku'li'laga V'aizilaeli v'ayage, Mulungu akav'alondolile ku'v'i'ti'la ku' nsi' ya V'afilisiti, ninga i'vi nzi'la yeni'yo yav'age ngu'hi'. Mulungu ndi' wayomba ati', “V'antu' v'enav'a u'lu' v'apome na wu'lu'gu' v'akowolile ku'galu'zya ndaka na ku'su'v'a ku' Misili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mulungu wav'alondolaga V'aizilaeli ku' nzi'la ya ku'pilima ku'v'i'ti'la ku' ibalangu', ku'londa ku' Nyanza ya Shamu. V'aizilaeli aho v'ali'wu'ka ku' Misili ndi' v'awu'ka v'iv'angile ku' wu'lu'gu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wagasolaga maguha gamwa Yosefu na ku'gayana, ki'gele v'akagazyi'ki'le u'ko v'ayile, ku'nguno Yosefu ndi' wav'alahi'li'zya v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli ati'. “Nhana Mulungu alamwizi'i'le na ku'mufumya mu nsi' yeni'yi', haho yi'lamudime ku'gasola maguha ganne ku'fuma hano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho V'aizilaeli v'awu'kaga ku' Sukoti, na v'atu'u'laga nkambi' ku' lwandi' lwa Etamu, ku' lu'v'i'mbi' lwa ibalangu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'alondolaga mu itungo lya lyu'v'a ku' lu'manyi'lo lwa ilunde i'lo lyav'age ki'ti' nhi'ngi', na wu'ziku' wav'atongelelage ku' lu'manyi'lo lwa moto u'go gwav'age ki'ti' nhi'ngi' na ku'v'amu'li'ki'la, ki'gele v'akowole ku'yu'mba lyu'v'a na wu'ziku'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' ha itungo lya lyu'v'a, na u'go moto gu'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' ha itungo lya wu'ziku', ndi' zikahafumaga ha mbele na v'antu' v'enav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
